or  $(AM*CM + BM*DM)/2 \ge \sqrt{ (\sqrt{(x/2)^2 + (y/2)^2})^4 }$ ;

or  $(AM*CM + BM*DM)/2 \ge \sqrt{[(x/2)^2 + (y/2)^2]^2}$ ;

or  $(AM*CM + BM*DM)/2 >=\ge (x/2)^2 + (y/2)^2 \ge 2\sqrt{(x/2)^2 * (y/2)^2}$ ;

